  "goodToKnow": "Das Quartier means lodging or quarters: ein Quartier für die Nacht, Soldaten ins Quartier legen. In urban planning and Switzerland, it's also a neighbourhood or district: ein neues Stadtquartier. Das Hauptquartier is headquarters. German Qu is pronounced kv: kvar-TEER. Don't confuse it with das Quartal (quarter of a year) or das Viertel (quarter of a city, or a quarter in general)."
